sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Svc as Service
    participant M as Metrics pipeline
    participant Ev as Budget evaluator
    participant St as Budget state
    participant N as Notifier
    participant Team as Service team
    Svc->>M: good and total event counts
    M->>Ev: SLI windows
    Ev->>Ev: burn rate = error rate ÷ budget rate
    Ev->>St: persist remaining budget
    alt fast burn (1h and 5m windows agree)
        Ev->>N: page — budget gone in hours
        N->>Team: page on-call
    else slow burn (6h and 30m agree)
        Ev->>N: ticket, not a page
        N->>Team: file ticket
    else within budget
        Ev-->>St: record, stay quiet
    end
